WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0104: a thrown attack plays WoW's throw.
Playtest feedback: the guard's Shoot "looked just like a long range basic attack instead of a tossing of a javelin". BG3
cast a javelin, and every stand-in attack played the melee swing. strikes.bin flag 32 (Mirrors.lua) names a thrown
weapon, and the swing carries it in a hit_info bit WoW's packets do not use: AttackThrown (107), if the model has it.
